artifact.the-great-expansion.brassBell.d:
{Brass Bell}

Reduces Incoming Spell Damage Reduction from enemy units by 20%, reduces their Magic Resistance by 20% and reduces their Magic Immunity Level Threshold by 1.

Negative Incoming Spell Damage Reduction causes enemies to receive more damage from spells.

mapObject.the-great-expansion.grandmaste:
{Grandmaster's Hall}

You are invited by an imposing warrior, who helps you train your troops.

(Units in the hero's army permanently have their damage and health increased by 6%.)

mapObject.the-great-expansion.heroicShri:
{Heroic Shrine}

You are invited by a venerable hero, who helps you train your troops.

(Units in the hero's army permanently have their max health increased by 1)

mapObject.the-great-expansion.veteransHa:
{Veteran's Hall}

You are invited by a venerable warrior, who helps you train your troops.

(Units of tier 3+ in the hero's army permanently have their damage increased by 1)

skill.the-great-expansion.irresistibleMa:
{Advanced Irresistible Magic}

Reduces Incoming Spell Damage Reduction from enemy units by 12% and reduces their Magic Resistance by 12%.

Negative Incoming Spell Damage Reduction causes enemies to receive more damage from spells.

{Basic Irresistible Magic}

Reduces Incoming Spell Damage Reduction from enemy units by 6% and reduces their Magic Resistance by 6%.

Negative Incoming Spell Damage Reduction causes enemies to receive more damage from spells.

{Expert Irresistible Magic}

Reduces Incoming Spell Damage Reduction from enemy units by 18%, reduces their Magic Resistance by 18% and reduces their Magic Immunity Level Threshold by 1.

Negative Incoming Spell Damage Reduction causes enemies to receive more damage from spells.

spell.the-great-expansion.acidBurst.desc:
{Advanced Acid Burst}

Deals earth damage to enemies in the chosen area.

Damage inflicted is 7 more than Basic Acid Burst.

{Expert Acid Burst}

Deals earth damage to enemies in the chosen area.

Damage inflicted is 14 more than Basic Acid Burst.

spell.the-great-expansion.anchor.descrip:
{Advanced Anchor}

Reduces the target's Defense and renders it unable to move. The effect is removed when the unit receives damage.

The reduction to Defense is twice as effective as from Basic Anchor.

{Expert Anchor}

Reduces the target's Defense and renders it unable to move. The effect is removed when the unit receives damage.

The reduction to Defense is thrice as effective as from Basic Anchor.

spell.the-great-expansion.blizzard.descr:
{Advanced Blizzard}

Deals water damage to all units in a small radius and reduces their Defense and Speed.

Damage inflicted is 25 more than from Basic Blizzard, and reduction is more effective than from Basic Blizzard.

{Expert Blizzard}

Deals water damage to all units in a small radius and reduces their Defense and Speed.

Damage inflicted is 75 more than from Basic Blizzard, and reduction is more effective than from Basic Blizzard.

spell.the-great-expansion.charge.descrip:
{Advanced Charge}

Causes the target to gain Speed and the Jousting ability. Lasts until an attack is made by the unit.

Bonus is 20% greater than from Basic Charge.

{Expert Charge}

Causes the target to gain Speed and the Jousting ability. Lasts until an attack is made by the unit.

Bonus is 40% greater than from Basic Charge.

spell.the-great-expansion.combustion.des:
{Advanced Combustion}

Deals fire damage to the target.

Damage inflicted is 35 more than Basic Combustion.

{Expert Combustion}

Deals fire damage to the target.

Damage inflicted is 95 more than Basic Combustion.

spell.the-great-expansion.darkInfusion.d:
{Advanced Dark Infusion}

Deals fire damage to the target, but also increases its Attack greatly. Can be used on both own and enemy units.

Damage dealt is 20 more than Basic Dark Infustion, and also grants a chance to apply Advanced Curse on attack.

{Expert Dark Infusion}

Deals fire damage to the target, but also increases its Attack greatly. Can be used on both own and enemy units.

Damage dealt is 55 more than Basic Dark Infustion, and also grants a chance to apply Advanced Curse on attack and a chance to deal double damage on attack.

spell.the-great-expansion.defender.descr:
{Advanced Defender}

The selected unit will gain increased Defense upon taking the Defend action.

The effect is twice as powerful as the basic version.

{Expert Defender}

All friendly units will gain increased Defense upon taking the Defend action.

The effect is twice as powerful as the basic version

spell.the-great-expansion.destiny.descri:
{Advanced Destiny}

Reduces Attack, Defense and Health of all enemy units. This effect stacks and lasts until end of battle.

The reduction is 1 point greater than from Basic Destiny.

{Expert Destiny}

Reduces Attack, Defense and Health of all enemy units. This effect stacks and lasts until end of battle.

The reduction is 2 points greater than from Basic Destiny.

spell.the-great-expansion.disarm.descrip:
{Advanced Disarm}

Reduces hand-to-hand damage dealt by the target.

The reduction is greater than from Basic Disarm.

{Expert Disarm}

Reduces hand-to-hand damage dealt by all enemy units.

The reduction is greater than from Basic Disarm.

spell.the-great-expansion.dominate.descr:
{Advanced Dominate}

Target troop is put under the hero's control.

Health threshold is greater by 75 than from Basic Dominate.

{Expert Dominate}

Target troop is put under the hero's control.

Health threshold is greater by 225 than from Basic Dominate.

spell.the-great-expansion.empower.descri:
{Advanced Empower}

Increases Max Damage of the target stack.

The bonus is twice as high as the bonus from the Basic Empower.

{Expert Empower}

Increases Max Damage of all friendly stacks.

The bonus is twice as high as the bonus from the Basic Empower.

spell.the-great-expansion.exorcism.descr:
{Advanced Exorcism}

Deals air damage to an undead target.

Damage inflicted is 30 more than Basic Exorcism.

{Expert Exorcism}

Deals air damage to an undead target.

Damage inflicted is 60 more than Basic Exorcism.

spell.the-great-expansion.huntersMark.de:
{Advanced Hunter's Mark}

Increases ranged damage received by the target.

The damage amplification is twice as effective as from Basic Hunter's Mark.

{Expert Hunter's Mark}

Increases ranged damage received by all enemy targets.

The reduction to Defense is twice as effective as from Basic Hunter's Mark.

spell.the-great-expansion.iceLance.descr:
{Advanced Ice Lance}

Deals water damage to the target and reduces its Speed for one turn.

Damage inflicted is 10 more and Speed reduction is 1 more than Basic Ice Lance.

{Expert Ice Lance}

Deals water damage to the target and reduces its Speed for one turn.

Damage inflicted is 20 more and Speed reduction is 2 more than Basic Ice Lance.

spell.the-great-expansion.innerFire.desc:
{Advanced Inner Fire}

Increases Attack, Speed, Morale and Luck of a single unit.

The bonus is twice as big as from Basic Inner Fire.

{Expert Inner Fire}

Increases Attack, Speed, Morale and Luck of all friendly stacks.

The bonus is twice as big as from Basic Inner Fire.

spell.the-great-expansion.lightningStorm:
{Lightning Storm}

Calls down lightning bolts to hit enemy units in the chosen area.

Damage inflicted is 30 more than Basic Lightning Storm.

{Lightning Storm}

Calls down lightning bolts to hit enemy units in the chosen area.

Damage inflicted is 100 more than Basic Lightning Storm.

spell.the-great-expansion.meltdown.descr:
{Advanced Meltdown}

Deals fire damage to all enemy units.

Damage inflicted is 30 more than Basic Meltdown.

{Expert Meltdown}

Deals fire damage to all enemy units.

Damage inflicted is 60 more than Basic Meltdown.

spell.the-great-expansion.plagueWind.des:
{Plague Wind}

Deals earth damage to all units in the chosen large area.

Damage inflicted is 16 more than Basic Plague Wind.

{Plague Wind}

Deals earth damage to all units in the chosen large area.

Damage inflicted is 48 more than Basic Plague Wind.

spell.the-great-expansion.raiseSkeletons:
{Advanced Raise Skeletons}

Permanently raises Skeletons from the chosen allied corpse.

Amount of Skeletons raised is 50% greater than from Basic Raise Skeletons.

{Expert Raise Skeletons}

Permanently raises Skeletons from the chosen allied corpse.

Amount of Skeletons raised is 100% greater than from Basic Raise Skeletons.

{Advanced Raise Vampires}

Permanently raises Vampires from the chosen allied corpse.

Amount of Vampires raised is 50% greater than from Basic Raise Vampires.

{Expert Raise Vampires}

