spell.the-great-expansion.rend.descripti:
{Advanced Rend}

Reduces the target's Defense for the duration of the spell.

The reduction is twice as effective as from Basic Rend.

{Expert Rend}

Reduces all enemy units' Defense for the duration of the spell.

The reduction is twice as effective as from Basic Rend.

spell.the-great-expansion.restore.descri:
{Advanced Restore}

Revives a small amount of Health to a friendly stack. The revived units stay after the battle ends.

Revies 10 more Health than Basic Restore.

{Expert Restore}

Revives a small amount of Health to a friendly stack. The revived units stay after the battle ends.

Revies 30 more Health than Basic Restore.

spell.the-great-expansion.shatter.descri:
{Advanced Shatter}

Increases melee damage received by the target.

The damage amplification is twice as effective as from Basic Shatter.

{Expert Shatter}

Increases melee damage received by all enemy units.

The damage amplification is twice as effective as from Basic Shatter.

spell.the-great-expansion.smite.descript:
{Advanced Smite}

Deals water damage to the target and prevents it from casting spells.

Damage inflicted is 40 more than Basic Smite.

{Expert Smite}

Deals water damage to the target and prevents it from casting spells.

Damage inflicted is 90 more than Basic Smite.

spell.the-great-expansion.stasis.descrip:
{Advanced Stasis}

Renders the target unable to act, but also greatly reduces damage received by it.

The target receives 50% more damage than if affected by Basic Stasis.

{Expert Stasis}

Renders the target unable to act, but also greatly reduces damage received by it.

The target receives 100% more damage than if affected by Basic Stasis.

spell.the-great-expansion.summonBoars.de:
