spell.the-great-expansion.sunder.descrip:
{Advanced Sunder}

Creates several traps that deal water damage to enemies that pass through.

Spawns two traps more, and each trap deals an additional 25 more damage than Basic Sunder.

{Expert Sunder}

Creates several traps that deal water damage to enemies that pass through.

Spawns four traps more, and each trap deals an additional 75 more damage than Basic Sunder.

spell.the-great-expansion.theGreatJourne:
{Advanced The Great Journey}

Reduces cost of travel for the rest of the day.

The reduction is greater than that from Basic The Great Journey.

{Expert The Great Journey}

Reduces cost of travel for the rest of the day.

The reduction is greater than that from Basic The Great Journey.

spell.the-great-expansion.venom.descript:
{Advanced Venom}

Envenoms the target, reducing its Max Health.

Health reduction is twice as effective as from Basic Venom.

{Expert Venom}

Envenoms all enemy units, reducing their Max Health.

Health reduction is twice as effective as from Basic Venom.

spell.the-great-expansion.vitality.descr:
{Advanced Vitality}

Increases the target's Max Health for the duration of the spell..

Health bonus is twice as effective as from Basic Vitality.

{Expert Vitality}

Increases all friendly units' Max Health for the duration of the spell.

Health bonus is twice as effective as from Basic Vitality.

spell.the-great-expansion.volt.descripti:
{Advanced Volt}

Deals air damage to the target and removes all positive buffs from it.

Damage inflicted is 45 more than Basic Volt.

{Expert Volt}

Deals air damage to the target and removes all positive buffs from it.

Damage inflicted is 140 more than Basic Volt.
